[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraVanish/release/images/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]True invisibility for your staff team.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraVanish hides staff members completely: from the tab list, the player count and the world. While vanished, the action bar permanently shows your status.
UltraVanish is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Completely invisible: tab list, player count, join and quit messages
[*]Open chests silently and without animation
[*]No mob targeting, no item pickup, no pressure plates
[*]Persistent status indicator in the action bar
[*]Vanish levels: higher ranks see lower ones
[*]Fake join and fake quit
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraVanish/release/images/gallery-1-layout.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraVanish in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultravanish language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraVanish/release/images/gallery-2-languages.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/vanish [spieler][/COLOR][/FONT] – Toggle vanish (others: ultravanish.vanish.others) [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultravanish.vanish)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/vanishlist[/COLOR][/FONT] – List vanished players [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultravanish.list)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/fakejoin · /fakequit[/COLOR][/FONT] – Send a fake message [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultravanish.fake)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultravanish <help|reload|version|language>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultravanish.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultravanish.level.<n>[/FONT] – Vanish level
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultravanish.see[/FONT] – See vanished players
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultravanish.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraVanish and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder. Works on [B]Spigot, Paper and Purpur 1.20.4+[/B] (Java 17+), no dependencies needed.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultravanish reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

